@subsubsection Metadata

WebDAV and CalDAV specifies a number of properties which all calendar
collections may implement. To avoid re-writing the XML parsing step
for each data store, these methods are provided as simpler
implementations.

Each getter provides a default implementation which returns @code{#f},
indicating that the store has no value for that resource.

